Subject: [PATCH 2612/3799] soh: rename func_80ACBEA0 -> EnOwl_Perched

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: waits on the perch until the animation ends, then starts the takeoff turned a quarter turn
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Owl/z_en_owl.c
